<title>USA: Baxter International sets $450 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Baxter International sets $450 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from Baxter International Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER BAXTER INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.992  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.126 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 48	   MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 5</p>
<p>						 BASIS POINTS OVER U.S.</p>
<p>						  TREASURY</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.65 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2027</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.859  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.662 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 70	   MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 5</p>
<p>						 BASIS POINTS OVER U.S.</p>
<p>						  TREASURY</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
